  "uncertain": [
   "u0013: Source is the unmarried form; used 'Milia Fallyna' (u0031 is the married form).",
   "u0022: Glossary status for this name is needs_check.",
   "u0023: Source writes the short form without the middle name; used glossary en 'Isamu Alva Dyson' per brief. Alternative: 'Isamu Dyson'.",
   "u0029: Source omits 'Flare'; used glossary en 'Mylene Flare Jenius' per brief.",
   "u0116: Pilot-table dummy entries used by skills (u0116-u0124); '(Skill)' renders the source's 'for skill use' tag.",
   "u0117: Matches the player title 'Pineapple Cake' in the dialogue translation.",
